The implementation is complete. The `crc24_pgp_update` function uses the same table-driven approach as `crc24q_rtcm3` (they share the `crc24q` lookup table since both use the same polynomial 0x864CFB), following the algorithm specified in RFC 4880 section 6.1:

```c
crc = ((crc << 8) & 0xFFFFFF) ^ crc24q[data[i] ^ (crc >> 16)]
```

